Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790222399999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790207999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The leg since bar 84 spends about 25 bars (87-111) inside a two-sided 2357.18-2680 band, so the leg is at least as range-like as trend-like and could be classified trading-range/channel rather than bull-trend.", "Momentum faded at the highs: bar 86 spiked to 2771 but closed 2515.3 with a long upper tail, and the 2643-2850 top area shows overlapping bars rather than clean trend bars.", "Bar 119 closes near its low (2684.16 in a 2641.37-2786.81 range) after a marginal new high 2850 versus the 2771 spike high, so an MTR from the high is not excluded.", "The first 84 bars of the window are bearish then rangebound, so the bull case rests only on roughly the last 36 bars."], "evidence_for": ["Higher swing lows dominate after bar 84: 2111 (bar 85 low), 2325.31 (bar 86 low), 2357.18 (bar 99 low), 2358.62 (bar 111 low), 2435.72 (bar 107 low).", "Higher swing highs over the same span: 2348.02 (bar 85), 2771 (bar 86), 2680 (bar 107), 2850 (bar 117).", "Bull bodies carry the advance: bar 84 opens 1916.51 and closes 2252.16, bar 107 opens 2437 and prints 2680, and bars 113-117 run from 2446.22 to a 2775.61 close.", "The current two-bar set-back (bars 118-119) is no deeper than the repeated pullbacks inside the 87-111 band, which is normal pullback behavior inside a bull leg."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Bars 0-10 form a bear leg: close slides from 2072.8 to 1568.55 and the window low 1368.42 is set on bar 10 (low 1368.42, close 1568.55).", "Bars 11-83 are a broad two-sided base bounded by low 1512.91 (bar 30) and high 1974.46 (bar 61); bars overlap heavily and every multi-bar swing is retraced.", "Bar 84 is a large bull breakout bar out of that base: open 1916.51, high 2293.8, low 1905.63, close 2252.16.", "Bar 85 closes 2326.32 (high 2348.02, low 2111); bar 86 spikes to 2771 but closes 2515.3, leaving a long upper tail.", "Bars 87-111 overlap in a 2357.18 (bar 99 low) to 2680 (bar 107 high) band, then bars 112-117 rally from 2358.62 to a new high 2850 (bar 117, close 2775.61).", "Bars 118-119 are consecutive bear bars; bar 119 opens 2752.43, trades 2641.37-2786.81 and closes 2684.16, in the lower part of its range and below bar 118's 2752.43 close."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Two-sided base after the opening bear leg: about 73 bars oscillating with heavy overlap between the 1512.91 low (bar 30) and the 1974.46 high (bar 61), with repeated failed pushes in both directions.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike out of the base: bar 84 (open 1916.51, high 2293.8, close 2252.16) clears the base by a wide margin, bar 85 closes 2326.32, bar 86 spikes to 2771 and closes 2515.3. No exact horizontal boundary is claimed for this impulsive leg.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": null}, {"description": "Post-spike consolidation and channel-like portion of the bull leg: bars 87-111 overlap between low 2357.18 (bar 99) and high 2680 (bar 107) while keeping higher lows, so the leg is channel-like rather than a clean spike.", "end_time_ms": 1789516799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Two-bar bear reversal attempt at the bull high: bar 117 makes a new high 2850 and closes 2775.61, then bars 118-119 turn down and bar 119 closes 2684.16 near its low. Higher high over the 2771 spike high (bar 86) plus only two bear bars means this is a potential reversal pattern, not a confirmed reversal.", "end_time_ms": 1790207999999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2641.37", "start_time_ms": 1789948800000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation is supported if a bar closes above 2786.81 (bar 119 high) and then above 2850 (bar 117 high) with a strong bull body and little overlap.", "A close below 2641.37 (bar 119 low), then below 2435.72 (bar 107 low) and 2358.62 (bar 111 low), would break the sequence of higher lows and weaken the bull read.", "A close below 2325.31 (bar 86 low) would negate the post-base breakout structure and favor a major-trend-reversal or trading-range classification.", "If subsequent bars keep overlapping and closing mid-range around 2600-2800 for many sessions, the read shifts from bull-trend/channel toward trading-range/range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": "unclear", "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790207999999, "directional_pressure": "balanced", "evidence_against": ["The pullback retraced about 74% of the 2568.16-2850 leg and lasted 15 bars versus a 7-bar leg, which makes the segment increasingly range-like.", "A lower high exists at 2804.59 versus the 2850 window high, the classic first piece of an mtr-like top after a wide-range bar.", "Bar 104 closed in the lower third of a 191.94-range bar (close 2723.15 against high 2850), a weak close with climactic characteristics.", "Bar 117's close 2659 broke below the 2716.01 shelf, and the decision close 2684.16 is still below that shelf, so the bear break has not been negated by structure.", "The window contains precedent for spike failure: the bar-45 spike to 2680 was fully retraced to 2358.62 (about -12%) within the same window."], "evidence_for": ["Successive higher swing highs since the breakout: 2519.81 (bar 86), 2643.52 (bar 88), 2700 (bars 92 and 102), 2850 (bar 104).", "Successive higher swing lows: 2469.24 (bar 85), 2568.16 (bar 98), 2641.37 (bar 118); the last higher low is intact and no prior higher low has been broken.", "The bull breakout was accepted: price never traded back inside the 2358.62-2519.81 base range after bar 87, despite a 15-bar pullback.", "Bar 118 is a reversal bar (low 2641.37, close 2676.47, above bar 117's close) and bar 119 closed 2684.16 near its high with a higher low, showing responsive bulls at the pullback low.", "The 2641.37 low matched the bars 102-103 support (2641.7 and 2646.02), consistent with a measured pullback to the prior consolidation rather than a trend-ending break."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Bar indices below count from the first supplied bar (index 0, open 2506.92) through index 119 (close 2684.16, the frozen decision bar).", "Window extremes: high 2850 (bar 104) and low 2358.62 (bar 70); the window closes 177.24 above its open.", "Bars 3-86 are largely two-sided: overlapping small bars mostly between 2411.04 (bar 39 low) and the 2520-2545 area; the bar-45 spike (open 2457.12, high 2680, close 2555.52, range 235.81) was retraced all the way to 2358.62 by bar 70.", "Bar 65 (open 2540.11, high 2609.02, close 2514.07, only 1.26 above its low) failed to hold above the 2607.62 high of bar 46, and the following decline broke the range low.", "Bars 87-88 produced the breakout: bar 87 (open 2507.15) closed 2578.6 above the 2519.81 high of bar 86, and bar 88 closed 2636.28; price never traded back inside the 2358.62-2519.81 base range.", "Bars 89-98 are an overlapping bull channel with pullback lows 2604.75 (bar 90) and 2568.16 (bar 98), both well above the breakout zone.", "Bars 99-104 are a second leg to 2850; bar 104 (open 2658.81, low 2658.06, range 191.94) closed 2723.15 in the lower third of its range, a weak close after a spike.", "Bars 105-107 stalled at highs 2795 and 2804.59, leaving a lower high versus 2850; bars 108-116 then held an overlapping seven-bar range between 2716.01 (bar 109 low) and 2804.59.", "Bar 117 (open 2726.71, high 2727.77, close 2659) closed below the 2716.01 shelf; bar 118 undercut to 2641.37 and reversed to close 2676.47 above bar 117's close, and bar 119 closed 2684.16 (high 2695.84).", "The 2641.37 pullback low retraces 208.63, about 74% of the 2568.16-2850 leg, and sits just below the 2641.7/2646.02 lows of bars 102-103 while holding above the prior higher low 2568.16.", "The pullback occupies 15 bars (105-119) versus the 7-bar leg from bar 98 to bar 104, and price at 2684.16 is still about 32 below the broken 2716.01 shelf."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Broad pre-breakout two-sided range spanning roughly bars 3-86; most bars overlap between about 2411 and 2545, with the spike high 2680 (bar 45) and the extreme low 2358.62 (bar 70) as its outer references.", "end_time_ms": 1789732799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1788523200000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Decisive bull breakout from the bars-70-to-86 base: bar 87 (open 2507.15) closed 2578.6 above the 2519.81 high of bar 86 and bar 88 closed 2636.28 with no return into the base range, i.e. accepted break rather than a one-bar spike.", "end_time_ms": 1789761599999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2495.82", "start_time_ms": 1789732800000, "upper_boundary": "2643.52"}, {"description": "Overlapping bull channel from bar 89 to the 2850 high (bar 104), with two pullbacks that held higher (lows 2604.75 at bar 90 and 2568.16 at bar 98) before the second leg up; the pullback floor of bars 85-98 rose from 2469.24 to 2568.16.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2568.16", "start_time_ms": 1789761600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Possible major-trend-reversal top: window high 2850 (bar 104, wide range closing in its lower third), lower high 2804.59 (bar 107), a seven-bar range 2716.01-2804.59, then bar 117 closing 2659 below the 2716.01 shelf; bars 118-119 (low 2641.37, close 2684.16) reversed back up, so the pattern is unconfirmed and no lower high has yet been followed by a break of 2568.16.", "end_time_ms": 1790207999999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2641.37", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull resumption: a close back above 2716.01 that holds on the next bar, followed by acceptance above 2786.81/2804.59, would negate the bear breakout and favor continuation toward the 2850 high.", "Continuation confirmation: a close above 2850 with follow-through would keep the bull trend as the primary read without qualification.", "Bear transition: a lower high below 2850 followed by a close below 2641.37 with follow-through (second close below, or a close below 2568.16) would break the higher-low sequence and shift the read toward trading-range/transition.", "Two-sided continuation: repeated overlapping bars between 2641.37 and 2804.59 with no boundary acceptance would keep the classification as a deep pullback inside the bull trend while always-in relevance stays limited."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2619", "close_time_ms": 1789793999999, "high": "2625.54", "low": "2612.43", "open": "2619.15", "open_time_ms": 1789790400000, "volume": "1584545.712"}, {"close": "2627.95", "close_time_ms": 1789797599999, "high": "2632.37", "low": "2618.74", "open": "2619", "open_time_ms": 1789794000000, "volume": "1980323.112"}, {"close": "2626.67", "close_time_ms": 1789801199999, "high": "2628.81", "low": "2619.71", "open": "2627.95", "open_time_ms": 1789797600000, "volume": "1216174.901"}, {"close": "2626.53", "close_time_ms": 1789804799999, "high": "2633.06", "low": "2622.67", "open": "2626.68", "open_time_ms": 1789801200000, "volume":